        "text": "At 11:18 / 11:23 / 11:26 UTC, the feature-bot pushed three commits across three repos in an eight-minute window — two of them aimed at the same launch surface. The same morning, $AEON printed a new all-time high and the deepest pool's liquidity hit an ATH of $1.76M. The framework now has the drafter, the drafter-in-the-fork, and the dashboard column to watch the launch from.",
